# Core Rules

**Full detail:** [docs/ai/05-core.md](../../docs/ai/05-core.md)

## Scope

`lib/core/` — shared infrastructure, not feature domain logic.

## DI

Register types in `lib/core/utils/service_locator.dart` via `setupServiceLocator()`.

- Singletons: `Dio`, `AuthRepo`, `ProductRepo`, `TokenCubit`, `VariantRepository`
- Factories: product cubits (new per provider)

Use `getIt<T>()`.

## Network

- Base URL + tenant from `MobileAppConfig.app`
- `AuthInterceptor` on `Dio` for authenticated routes
- Public catalog: `/api/v1/public/*` — no auth header

## Routing

`AppRouter.setupRouter` — all config routes → `VariantScreen`. Tab shell via `TabShellWidget`.

## Must not

- Parse page JSON or map component types here
- Add product-specific API paths (belongs in features)

## Auth

`TokenCubit`, `AuthRedirect`, `AuthTokenStorage` — session lifecycle
